ity.\n* Ability to propose solutions for design and architecture.\n* Demonstrated experience in complex software troubleshooting techniques.\n* Experience in Product Engineering is desirable.\n* Exposure to Windows Azure is an added advantage.\n\n\n**Responsibilities**\n**Architecture \\& System Design**\n* Design scalable, resilient, and maintainable systems for enterprise applications\n* Define architecture standards, design patterns, and best practices across modules\n* Ensure system design aligns with performance, security, and scalability requirements\n\n\n**Technical Leadership**\n* Guide teams on architecture principles, coding standards, and design decisions\n* Conduct design and architecture reviews to ensure quality and consistency\n* Mentor engineers on system design and technical problem\\-solving\n\n\n**Modern Engineering (Added for current market)**\n* Drive implementation of microservices and cloud\\-native architectures\n* Enable adoption of AI\\-assisted development workflows (Copilot, prompt\\-based design)\n* Support integration of AI/ML components into application workflows\n\n\n**Platform \\& Performance**\n* Identify and resolve system bottlenecks and architectural issues\n* Ensure performance, scalability, and reliability of applications\n* Contribute to observability and monitoring strategies\n\n\n**DevOps \\& Cloud**\n* Support CI/CD and DevOps practices for efficient development and deployment\n* Work closely on cloud architecture (Azure preferred)\n* Drive containerization and deployment best practices\n\n\n**Collaboration**\n* Collaborate with product and stakeholders to translate requirements into solutions\n* Work with cross\\-functional teams to drive delivery and alignment\n\n\n**Experience**\n**QUALIFICATIONS**\n* 10\u201312 years of software development experience with hands\\-on design ownership\n* 2\u20134 years of experience in architecture or system design roles\n* Experience working in enterprise SaaS / product engineering setups\n\n\n**Technical Skills**\n* Strong expertise in .NET, C\\#, microservices architecture, and cloud platforms (Azure preferred)\n* Solid understanding of system design, design patterns, and distributed systems\n* Strong experience with SQL/NoSQL databases and performance tuning\n\n\n**Modern Stack (Market aligned)**\n* Experience with:\n+ Microservices \\& event\\-driven architectures\n+ Containerization (Docker, Kubernetes)\n+ Observability tools (App Insights, Grafana, etc.)\n\n* Exposure to AI/ML or GenAI integration in applications\n\n\n**Engineering Practices**\n* Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines, DevOps practices, and automation\n* Strong understanding of secure coding and reliability practices\n\n\n**Soft Skills**\n* Strong collaboration and communication skills\n* Ability to influence design decisions and drive alignment\n* Ownership mindset with focus on execution\n\n\n**About Us**\n Icertis is the global leader in AI\\-powered contract intelligence. The Icertis platform revolutionizes contract management, equipping customers with powerful insights and automation to grow revenue, control costs, mitigate risk, and ensure compliance \\- the pillars of business success. Today, more than one third of the Fortune 100 trust Icertis to realize the full intent of millions of commercial agreements in 90\\+ countries.\n   \n\n  \n\n**About The Team**\n Who we a re: Icertis is the only contract intelligence platform companies trust to keep them out in front, now and in the future. Our unwavering commitment to contract intelligence is grounded in our FORTE values\u2014Fairness, Openness, Respect, Teamwork and Execution\u2014which guide all our interactions with employees, customers, partners, and stakeholders. Because in our mission to be the contract intelligence platform of the world, we believe how we get there is as important as the destination.\n   \n\n  \n\n Icertis, Inc. provides Equal Employment Opportunity to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender identity or expression, sex, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, amnesty, or status as a covered veteran in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws. Icertis, Inc. complies with applicable state and local laws governing non\\-discrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. If you are in need of accommodation or special assistance to navigate our website or to complete your application, please send an e\\-mail with your request to careers@icertis.com or get in touch with your recruiter."},{"title":"Planner I","company":"Jabil Circuit India","location":"Pune","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-planner-i-jabil-circuit-pune-1-to-2-years-070726503734","experience":"1-2 Yrs","skills":[103]},{"title":"Lead Specialist - Financial Reporting & Controls","company":"Artex Risk Solutions","location":"Pune","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-lead-specialist-financial-reporting-controls-artex-risk-solutions-pune-7-to-12-years-070726503666","experience":"7-12 Yrs"},{"title":"Content Writer Intern","company":"Btw Financial Services & Imf","location":"Pune","date_posted":"2026-07-09","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-content-writer-intern-btw-financial-services-thane-pune-lower-parel-0-to-1-years-090726912122","experience":"0-1 Yrs","skills":[103,109]},{"title":"Content Writer","company":"Benzy Infotech","location":"Pune","date_posted":"2026-07-09","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-content-writer-benzy-infotech-pvt-ltd-pune-1-to-4-years-090726504630","experience":"1-4 Yrs","skills":[9,107]},{"title":"AI Content Writer","company":"Vega Moon Technologies","location":"Pune","date_posted":"2026-07-09","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-ai-content-writer-vega-moon-technologies-pune-1-to-2-years-090726501370","experience":"1-2 Yrs","skills":[107,10